                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNGEN ZUR ÄSTHETISCHEN BEHANDLUNG BIOLOGISCHER STRUKTUREN DURCH HOCHFREQUENZ UND MAGNETISCHE ENERGIE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIFS POUR LE TRAITEMENT ESTHÉTIQUE DE STRUCTURES BIOLOGIQUES PAR RADIOFRÉQUENCE ET ÉNERGIE MAGNÉTIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DEVICES FOR AESTHETIC TREATMENT OF BIOLOGICAL STRUCTURES BY RADIOFREQUENCY AND MAGNETIC ENERGY</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention refers to a treatment device, in particular for aesthetic treatment of a patient, comprising a switching device, an energy storage device configured for providing a signal to a magnetic field generating device and a radiofrequency electrode configured to provide radiofrequency treatment in form of radiofrequency waves in order to cause heating of the patient, wherein the radiofrequency electrode and magnetic field generating device are configured to cause heating and muscle contraction at the same time during a treatment session, wherein the magnetic field generating device is configured to provide magnetic treatment comprising a time-varying magnetic field having a magnetic flux density in a range of 0.5 Tesla to 7 Tesla and a repetition rate of the magnetic impulses in the range of 0.1 Hz to 700 Hz in order to cause muscle contraction to the patient, and wherein the radiofrequency electrode is positioned between the magnetic field generating device and the patient.</p>
            </abstract>
